The cases under cases/ are built from issues, fixes and tests of these upstream projects, taken
from the Multi-SWE-bench dataset (https://huggingface.co/datasets/ByteDance-Seed/Multi-SWE-bench)
and from merged upstream pull requests outside it. Each case's patch.diff edits the upstream fix.
The recipe clones each upstream at the base sha its case.json names; no upstream source tree is
vendored here.

